WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit with the right shin parallel in front, knee bent about 90 degrees.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Swing the left leg behind with the knee also near 90 degrees.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Square the chest forward and sit tall.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Optional: hinge forward over the front shin.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then switch sides.
